# Phases 51 & 52: Pure Reality & Legacy Purge

This plan outlines the total transition from a "local tool" to an independent, production-grade platform.

## User Review Required

> [!WARNING]
> **Phase 52** involves removing all legacy Solana dependencies from the swarm core.
> **Phase 51** will switch the application from "Simulation Mode" (mocks) to "Reality Mode" (live production APIs). This requires valid production credentials for all integrated services.

## Proposed Changes

### Phase 52: Legacy Purge

#### [MODIFY] [loop.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/loop.ts)
- Strip `@solana/web3.js` imports.
- Refactor transaction/wallet logic into agnostic "Truth Anchor" verification stubs.

#### [MODIFY] [package.json](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/package.json)
- Remove all `@solana/` dependencies.
- Ensure [tsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/pages/CommandCenter.tsx) and core swarm dependencies are healthy.

---

### Phase 51: Pure Reality

#### [NEW] [SovereignGit.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/core/git/SovereignGit.ts)
- Implement autonomic commit and push logic.
- Integrate "Truth Anchor" validation before pushing.

#### [MODIFY] [SovereignDashboard.tsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/components/SovereignDashboard.tsx)
- Upgrade HUD to show Build #, Sync Status, and Kernel Score.

#### [MODIFY] [src/api/](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/api/)
- Eliminate mocks. Replace with authenticated production streams.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Global scan: `grep -r "@solana" .` (Must return zero results in functional code).
- Build check: `npm run build` after dependency purge.
- Swarm cycle: Execute loop and verify Git commit generation.

### Manual Verification
- Review Dashboard metrics for "Live" status synchronization.
- Verify production API connectivity.
